  "body": "Synapse version:  v1.65.0\r\nLinux version: 20.04\r\n\r\nWhen admin deactivate a user, the presence of the deactivated user remains online. The application is taking the presence of deactivated user from cache. When we logout and login then deactivated user's presence shows offline. \r\nWhat can i do so that it doesn't take presence from cache?\r\n\r\n\r\n",
